      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah, seeing the looks option feels off; I feel like the option should be moved into maybe the options menu or tools, or something. Sometimes I accidentally open the menu for no reason because of muscle memory. I feel like the option should not show up if there are no presets or whatever the \"looks\" menu shows in that menu. It is kinda annoying.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
