      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "An option to hide this and the items menu would be grand, even if you just tuck it away in an ini file somewhere.  (Pardon me if the option is already there!)  I appreciate the benefits these additions bring to many users, but personally I don't ever expect to use accessories (I make things myself, etc), and I use items seldom enough that going through the big menu is 100% ookay wiith me.\n\nAny extraneous choices make the \"quick\" menu more error-prone (i.e. notably less quick) with the wee thumbsticks found on VR controllers, and especially if you have some niche controllers, like UDCap gloves where the difference between the virtual and physical stick angles varies with the bending of the finger the controls are mounted to.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
