      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "One other issue i do not see here with it is that with this addition it is no longer possible to flick right 90°, since that is the edge of the expression menu, and since VRC prioritizes the next menu option in such cases, i click looks, leaving me to enter a useless menu assuming i am in expressions i then try to click an option but click the exit, and then boom i am then back where i started, and now am doing random stuff, rather than navigating my avatar menu that i already have memorized.\n\nBut also, like LupusCarnifex said, it would be an amazing feature to be able to toggle what main options are available in the radial menu, since i almost never use the stickers/emojis, items, the quick toggles (tools) just mess me up every time i enter them leaving me to toggle stuff i don't want to, and the looks feature is literally an exit loop.\n\nI just need expressions, and options, maybe mirror settings in place of \"tools\" so i can like.. edit my mirror without having to go trough settings, maybe the emoji/stickers/items combined into a 3rd option if i ever want to access it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
